  "notes": "USAGE:\nThe noun form {見積|みつ}もり (estimate, quotation) is extremely common in business. It can also be written {見積|みつ}り. The expressions {多|おお}めに{見積|みつ}もる (to overestimate) and {少|すく}なめに{見積|みつ}もる (to underestimate) are frequently used.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {費用|ひよう}を{見積|みつ}もる: to estimate costs\n- {多|おお}めに{見積|みつ}もる: to estimate on the high side\n- {少|すく}なめに{見積|みつ}もる: to estimate on the low side\n- ～と{見積|みつ}もられる: to be estimated at...\n- {見積|みつ}もりを{出|だ}す: to give a quotation",
